# Keeps Docker build contexts lean and, more importantly, correct — a
# stale local node_modules or dist directory leaking into a build context
# is exactly the kind of thing that causes confusing, hard-to-reproduce
# npm ci / build failures that only happen in CI.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.nx
.angular
target
**/target
build
**/build
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
